<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:36,110 --> 00:01:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

32
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was an emergency transmission
from the training room!</font>

33
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world happened?!</font>

34
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, the star was stolen.</font>

35
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The enemy is a ninja
who flies using chakra!</font>

36
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

37
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never heard of
a flying Shinobi.</font>

38
00:01:58,010 --> 00:01:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

39
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I lost him...</font>

40
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what Naruto said is true.</font>

41
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he can fly
using chakra...</font>

42
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's an incredible Shinobi.</font>

43
00:02:30,790 --> 00:02:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it was true.</font>

44
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You didn't believe
what I said?!</font>

45
00:02:36,090 --> 00:02:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You could say that.</font>

46
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that?</font>

47
00:02:39,010 --> 00:02:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do I have that little credibility?!</font>

48
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:48,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Natsuhiboshi</font>

49
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:48,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Memento Lullaby</font>

50
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the star of
the Village Hidden in Stars</font>

51
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is a meteorite, huh?</font>

52
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

53
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The First Hoshikage...</font>

54
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what they call
the village leader.</font>

55
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He discovered that if
you train by the "star..."</font>

56
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra is strengthened.</font>

57
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since then...</font>

58
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Hidden Star has been
in a unique position</font>

59
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even among the ninja hidden villages.</font>

60
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it says in these documents</font>

61
00:03:32,150 --> 00:03:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the training hasn't been conducted
these past ten years...</font>

62
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The leader who called himself
the Third Hoshikage</font>

63
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">prohibited the training...</font>

64
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But about a year ago...</font>

65
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they started again
after that Hoshikage died...</font>

66
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why? Why do something
like prohibit training?</font>

67
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows?</font>

68
00:03:51,540 --> 00:03:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a classified matter of
the Village Hidden in the Stars, so...</font>

69
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there were various rumors
circulating around about it...</font>

70
00:03:59,090 --> 00:03:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rumors?</font>

71
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... Rumors about most
of the Ninja who trained dying...</font>

72
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra is forcibly strengthened
by the power of the unknown star.</font>

73
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There may have been
adverse effects on the body.</font>

74
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"STARS"</b></font>

75
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

76
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star was stolen?!</font>

77
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! The people who were
training were at the scene,</font>

78
00:04:38,290 --> 00:04:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they were all knocked out
by an enemy jutsu...</font>

79
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pathetic!</font>

80
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say that,
but that ninja had incredible chakra!</font>

81
00:04:48,010 --> 00:04:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, is it that incredible?</font>

82
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Turning chakra
into monsters or wings.</font>

83
00:04:53,850 --> 00:04:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time I ever saw that!</font>

84
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true, Sumaru?</font>

85
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:01,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

86
00:05:02,530 --> 00:05:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the Ninja Art: Kujaku,
no mistake!</font>

87
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the jutsu passed on
in the Village Hidden in the Stars, huh?</font>

88
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... As for that Jutsu, only those
who have mastered the star training can...</font>

89
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

90
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten...</font>

91
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The secrets of a jutsu are not to
be spoken of or asked about lightly.</font>

92
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially with a jutsu that can only
be passed on to those of that village...</font>

93
00:05:29,470 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

94
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi,
please give me an order!</font>

95
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star being stolen
is my responsibility.</font>

96
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

97
00:05:40,570 --> 00:05:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star was stolen</font>

98
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though we were commissioned
a mission to protect it.</font>

99
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's also our responsibility.</font>

100
00:05:46,490 --> 00:05:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will get the star back by
our own hands, no matter what!</font>

101
00:05:49,450 --> 00:05:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I will leave the search for
the star to the Leaf Shinobi...</font>

102
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru, you keep an eye
on your injured comrades.</font>

103
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But only those in the village
know village matters...!</font>

104
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an order!</font>

105
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Are your friends who got beaten up
by the enemy ninja okay?</font>

106
00:06:16,930 --> 00:06:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's none of your business!</font>

107
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

108
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the end of the day, you're still
ninja from some other village!</font>

109
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not my friends or anything!</font>

110
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with him?!</font>

111
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, you're talking about
taking responsibility,</font>

112
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we haven't even seen
the scene of the theft.</font>

113
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:35,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
And we don't have any leads.</font>

114
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, we do.</font>

115
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't pick up on it?</font>

116
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi the village leader
knows something!</font>

117
00:06:44,090 --> 00:06:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by
knowing something?</font>

118
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,</font>

119
00:06:47,590 --> 00:06:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when Sumaru was talking about
the Kujaku something or other,</font>

120
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his expression changed.</font>

121
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that means the culprit is
someone associated with this village?</font>

122
00:06:55,890 --> 00:06:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, like I said, what does this mean?!</font>

123
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:01,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make a go around the village</font>

124
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and look for something that
could make for a lead.</font>

125
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee and Tenten, you keep watch over
that village leader called Akahoshi.</font>

126
00:07:07,490 --> 00:07:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand!</font>

127
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to us!</font>

128
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't get it!
What the heck should I do?!</font>

129
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see...
You investigate from Sumaru's angle.</font>

130
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Leave Sumaru to me.</font>

131
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I'm off for a run!</font>

132
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as always...</font>

133
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto sure is
an impetuous person, isn't he?</font>

134
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi, why are you so red?</font>

135
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I had a sad dream last night</font>

136
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eyes are red
From the tears I shed</font>

137
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:08,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Swollen as I cried</font>

138
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi, why've you lost your way?</font>

139
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm searching for a child
Who has gone afar</font>

140
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sad dreams come once more</font>

141
00:08:38,530 --> 00:08:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Sumaru!</font>

142
00:08:41,290 --> 00:08:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

143
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing! I was just looking
at the stars!</font>

144
00:08:46,830 --> 00:08:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stars?</font>

145
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it, you can see
the stars well in this village.</font>

146
00:08:53,170 --> 00:08:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That red star's sure pretty...</font>

147
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi...</font>

148
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:01,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It watches over me all the time...</font>

149
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Hold it. I want to go
visit your friends.</font>

150
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, here...</font>

151
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've brought the Hidden Leaf specialty
Roasted Chestnut Bean Jelly!</font>

152
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go if you like!
It's right near the training room!</font>

153
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A cold-hearted guy as usual...</font>

154
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Is nobody here?</font>

155
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to bother you.</font>

156
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:52,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is everyone?</font>

157
00:09:53,530 --> 00:09:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, is somebody sleeping?</font>

158
00:09:58,450 --> 00:09:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"AMAGURIAMA CHESTNUT BEAN JELLY"</b></font>

159
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it... Hokuto.</font>

160
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can tell... He's not an enemy.</font>

161
00:10:13,710 --> 00:10:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura...!</font>

162
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little!</font>

163
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A girl...?</font>

164
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?</font>

165
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a ninja from the Village Hidden
in the Leaves, Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

166
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to this village
to protect the star!</font>

167
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...?</font>

168
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:39,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry for my rough behavior!</font>

169
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's cool. I just came to visit...</font>

170
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the Roasted
Chestnut Bean Jelly?</font>

171
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! That's it!</font>

172
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

173
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake...</font>

174
00:10:57,970 --> 00:11:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it was that person who
made off with the star, after all...</font>

175
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're saying
that one's still alive...?</font>

176
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then this will be difficult.</font>

177
00:11:06,180 --> 00:11:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one being the final ninja
completely trained</font>

178
00:11:08,770 --> 00:11:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the power of the star means...</font>

179
00:11:11,690 --> 00:11:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not an opponent we can handle
with the likes of our Jutsu!</font>

180
00:11:14,730 --> 00:11:15,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get flustered...</font>

181
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the culprit is who we think it is,</font>

182
00:11:18,490 --> 00:11:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we already hold that one's weakness
in our hands.</font>

183
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it...</font>

184
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's grab that person up.</font>

185
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...</font>

186
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First we must avert the eyes
of the annoying flies!</font>

187
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...
My name is Hokuto...</font>

188
00:11:46,470 --> 00:11:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt chakra from someone not
of this village...</font>

189
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I carelessly...</font>

190
00:11:57,190 --> 00:11:59,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the flavor won't change, so eat up.</font>

191
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

192
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:08,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my... It really is good!</font>

193
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right? Right?</font>

194
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say... What happened to the others?</font>

195
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thief just put us to sleep...</font>

196
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There wasn't such a great deal
of damage.</font>

197
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

198
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay?</font>

199
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:30,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for saving my butt back there!</font>

200
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there something wrong with you?</font>

201
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... nothing at all...</font>

202
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:41,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After Mizura began the star training,
he started to feel poorly...</font>

203
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto! Don't be talking about the star</font>

204
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to someone from another village!</font>

205
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Mizura...?!</font>

206
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. I got carried away...</font>

207
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Other village...
You guys are kind of cold-hearted.</font>

208
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially that Sumaru guy...</font>

209
00:12:58,750 --> 00:12:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

210
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's a reason
why Sumaru became like that.</font>

211
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

212
00:13:05,130 --> 00:13:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It happened ten years ago...</font>

213
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's parents, who
were protecting the star,</font>

214
00:13:20,070 --> 00:13:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">were killed by ninja from
some other village...</font>

215
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who came to steal the star.</font>

216
00:13:25,570 --> 00:13:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So probably, he's...</font>

217
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's what it was about...
That's why he got like that.</font>

218
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:40,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So where is Sumaru...?
And where are the other guys?</font>

219
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems everyone went
to take back the star.</font>

220
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?</font>

221
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've come out.</font>

222
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:05,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

223
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should take them on
fair and square here...</font>

224
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! There would be
no point to surveillance!</font>

225
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:13,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not much one for
sniffing around secretly.</font>

226
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet. They'll notice us!</font>

227
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:25,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave the trailing ninjutsu to me...
Follow me quietly!</font>

228
00:14:26,090 --> 00:14:26,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

229
00:14:27,050 --> 00:14:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a mission!</font>

230
00:14:29,590 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand...</font>

231
00:14:31,100 --> 00:14:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go...!</font>

232
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Secretly, secretly...</font>

233
00:14:45,690 --> 00:14:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay... They haven't noticed.</font>

234
00:14:48,530 --> 00:14:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I get the feeling this kind of thing
goes against my Way of Ninja...</font>

235
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't complain!</font>

236
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Secretly, secretly...</font>

237
00:14:55,490 --> 00:14:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to say secretly, secretly!</font>

238
00:14:57,410 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But is this really a trailing ninjutsu?</font>

239
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have we been noticed?</font>

240
00:15:07,090 --> 00:15:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...</font>

241
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears we weren't noticed...</font>

242
00:15:26,940 --> 00:15:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's continue trailing them!</font>

243
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! They turned right!</font>

244
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger!</font>

245
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They vanished...</font>

246
00:15:42,210 --> 00:15:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did they give us the slip?</font>

247
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be, they noticed us?</font>

248
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! We're not enemies!</font>

249
00:15:58,060 --> 00:15:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

250
00:15:58,890 --> 00:16:01,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We came here on a mission from
the Village Hidden in the Leaves!</font>

251
00:16:01,770 --> 00:16:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Leaf Shinobi, you say?</font>

252
00:16:05,190 --> 00:16:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then aren't you guys trailing
the wrong people?</font>

253
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might be so.</font>

254
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's the possibility that
you guys have transformed</font>

255
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into people from this village, so...</font>

256
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brave words.</font>

257
00:16:17,950 --> 00:16:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I apologize for the rudeness...</font>

258
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now the star has been stolen.</font>

259
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we don't have any leads...</font>

260
00:16:24,330 --> 00:16:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why
you were investigating us, huh?</font>

261
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:30,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was unnecessary...</font>

262
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, well... We will take back
the star with our own hands.</font>

263
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys just make sure
you don't get in our way!</font>

264
00:16:39,970 --> 00:16:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They kind of tick me off...</font>

265
00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's as Neji said...</font>

266
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems there's some kind
of secret in this village, eh?</font>

267
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:47,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems so...</font>

268
00:16:53,950 --> 00:16:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone... join hands!</font>

269
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up! Pick up the same
star chakra as us!</font>

270
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!</font>

271
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't cut a rope
woven with chakra!</font>

272
00:17:54,550 --> 00:17:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give back the star!
That's our life!</font>

273
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, have you seen Sumaru
and the others?</font>

274
00:18:09,150 --> 00:18:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You weren't keeping watch of him?</font>

275
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, it seems most of the guys
went out to look for the star.</font>

276
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

277
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... is it okay to be all relaxed?</font>

278
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is something wrong?</font>

279
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's massive chakra
at the Valley of Death.</font>

280
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he appear again?!</font>

281
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:39,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go!
— All right!</font>

282
00:19:15,250 --> 00:19:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give back our... star...</font>

283
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it back...</font>

284
00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

285
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

286
00:19:38,570 --> 00:19:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku!</font>

287
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

288
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

289
00:19:56,170 --> 00:19:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell!</font>

290
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

291
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

292
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

293
00:20:05,970 --> 00:20:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me go! Let me go, I say!</font>

294
00:20:08,430 --> 00:20:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down!</font>

295
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up ahead is the valley filled
with poison gas...</font>

296
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

297
00:20:21,780 --> 00:20:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You would've been dead meat
in a few seconds without that mask on...</font>

298
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. We almost had him.</font>

299
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:30,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that was the Shinobi
who stole the star?</font>

300
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Absolutely no doubt about it!</font>

301
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why is it necessary
to go out of his way</font>

302
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to take Sumaru away although
he carried out his goal already?</font>

303
00:20:40,210 --> 00:20:42,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does that have something to do</font>

304
00:20:42,170 --> 00:20:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the star being targeted
ten years ago?</font>

305
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, it seems Sumaru's parents
got killed protecting the star.</font>

306
00:20:51,430 --> 00:20:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

307
00:21:13,370 --> 00:21:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="30"><font face="Myriad Pro Cond"><b>kinou wa Call Sign zenbu keitai de</b></font></font></font>

